(7461346, 1181926, 86447, '<td valign="top">You might know (or not) that I''ve added your image to my Faves.  I REALLY enjoy this image.<br/> <br/>So... you should know... that when I tell you that... the lamp post ending in her right foot really threw me off... <br/> <br/>I thought it was part of "the message"... that she was lifting it with her foot.   <br/> <br/>If even a tiny bit of that lamp post had shown beneath her foot... (and if there''d been more than one rendition of the lamp post ... even a digitally altered one), it would have been a bit better, IMHO.<br/> <br/>I say this because I love to find the flaws in my creations... from others or by myself.<br/> <br/>(NOT that this is a flaw... at all...  just what I found as disconcerting)<br/> <br/>And... thanks again for your photog notes.<br/> <br/>I look there each time you get TT and... and... wish for something from you when I go to give back and see that there''s nothing there from you.<br/> <br/>Again, this image is... just totally amazing.<br/> <br/>I love the simple gradient background with all of the busy, real stuff in the foreground.<br/> <br/>I''m so very impressed and entertained, Judi!<br/> <br/>I''ve been back to look so MANY times...<br/></td>', 'You might know (or not) that I''ve added your image to my Faves.  I REALLY enjoy this image. So... you should know... that when I tell you that... the lamp post ending in her right foot really threw me off...  I thought it was part of "the message"... that she was lifting it with her foot.    If even a tiny bit of that lamp post had shown beneath her foot... (and if there''d been more than one rendition of the lamp post ... even a digitally altered one), it would have been a bit better, IMHO. I say this because I love to find the flaws in my creations... from others or by myself. (NOT that this is a flaw... at all...  just what I found as disconcerting) And... thanks again for your photog notes. I look there each time you get TT and... and... wish for something from you when I go to give back and see that there''s nothing there from you. Again, this image is... just totally amazing. I love the simple gradient background with all of the busy, real stuff in the foreground. I''m so very impressed and entertained, Judi! I''ve been back to look so MANY times...', '2016-06-22 21:48:27.000000', NULL, 0),
